<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod prices rise yr/yr in March.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod prices rise yr/yr in March.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production prices rose 1.9 percent year-on-year in March, while month-on-month it slipped 0.5 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>				     March 97    Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p>General Index		     121.3	122.0	  119.0</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	 1.9	  3.2	     --</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	-0.5	 -0.1	     --</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	   3.3	  3.3	     --</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
</text>
